===Etymology===
{{etymon|en|:inh|enm:bache<ety:inh<ang:bæċ<id:brook>>>|tree=1}}
From {{inh|en|enm|[[bache]], [[bæcche]]||bank, sandbank}}, from {{inh|en|ang|beċe||beck, brook, stream}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*baki}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*bakiz||brook}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*bʰeg-||flowing water|id=water}}.
{{col-top|2|cog}}
Cognate with {{cog|cim|pach|t=brook, creek, stream}}, {{cog|nl|beek|t=brook, stream}}, {{cog|de|Bach|t=brook, stream}}, {{cog|nds-de|Beek|t=brook, stream}}, {{cog|lb|Baach|t=brook, stream}}, {{cog|mhn|pòch|t=brook, creek, stream}}, {{cog|wym|bāh}}, {{m|wym|baoch|t=brook, stream}}, {{cog|da|bæk|t=brook}}, {{cog|is|bekkur|t=creek, spring, stream}}, {{cog|nb,nn|bekk|t=brook, creek, stream}}, {{cog|sv|bäck|t=brook, creek, stream}}; also {{cog|lt|banga|t=billow, wave}}. More at {{m|en|batch}}, {{m|en|beck}}.
{{col-bottom}}

